{
  "dom_id": "step-e8384",
  "name": "Example: Evaluating Hyperbolic Tangent",
  "problem": "Evaluate $\\tanh{4}.$",
  "worked_solution": "The definition of $\\tanh x$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tanh}\u2061x & =\\frac{{e}^{x}-{e}^{-x}}{{e}^{x}+{e}^{-x}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{2x}-1}{{e}^{2x}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1-{e}^{-2x}}{1+{e}^{-2x}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the second definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{tanh}\u20614 & =\\frac{{e}^{2(4)}-1}{{e}^{2(4)}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{{e}^{8}-1}{{e}^{8}+1}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
